  "kind": "project",
  "name": "Bug tracker",
  "publisher": "Initiative",
  "description": "Reports come in, get sorted, get fixed. In that order, ideally.",
  "long_description": "New bugs land in Triage, where somebody decides how bad each one is before it goes to the Backlog. From there it is In progress, In review and Done, or Won't fix for the ones that are really features.\n\nEvery report has a severity, the part of the product it is in, the version it was found in and whether anyone has made it happen twice. Severity says how bad it is for the person who hit it. Priority says when you will get to it. They are allowed to disagree.",
